ाइ Philosophies

Theգ to be blazing fast, without compromising on accuracyडAccuracy**

The number one ofգ accuracy. However, it's not unusual for different glob implementations to have different rulesজ behavior, even with simple wildcard matching. It gets increasingly more complicated when combinations of different features are combined, like whenפ are combined with globstars,Τুট so on: `!(**/{a,b,*/c})`.

Thus, given that there is no canonical glob specificationவ as a single source of truth when differences of opinion arise regarding behavior, sometimes we have to implement our best judgement and rely on feedback from users to make improvementsडPerformance**

Although this library performs well in benchmarksট in most cases it's faster than other popular libraries we benchmarked against, we will always choose accuracy over performance. It's not helpful to anyone if our library is faster at returning the wrong answer.

